{
  "label": "nib_candy",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I finally get off of the bed.",
      "zh": "我终于从床上下来了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "My left foot stings as it comes into contact with the floor.",
      "zh": "左脚一碰到地板就刺痛。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I put all of the pressure onto my right foot to alleviate the pain.",
      "zh": "我把全部重量压到右脚上，以减轻疼痛。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder if this is how Reina feels?",
      "zh": "我在想，Reina 是不是就是这种感觉？"
    },
    {
      "en": "You won’t understand that if you decided to neglect her in the beginning of the game.",
      "zh": "要是你当初决定疏远她，你就不会懂的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Carefully, I hobble my way over to the candy shelf.",
      "zh": "我小心翼翼地一瘸一拐挪到糖果架前。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I take two and shove them into my mouth.",
      "zh": "我拿了两颗塞进嘴里。"
    },
    {
      "en": "A delicious breakfast.",
      "zh": "一份美味的早餐。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any more than two would be dangerous to my health.",
      "zh": "超过两颗就会危害我的健康。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s greet the world.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 来跟世界打个招呼吧。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bedroom_day",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/bedroom_day.jpg",
      "alt": "bedroom_day"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh, I guess it’s daytime after all.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 啊，看来现在果然是白天。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wonder if Saki is coming over today?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 我在想，Saki 今天会不会过来？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": She is! I can see her heading this way now!",
      "spk": "Josh",
      "zh": ": 她会！我现在就能看见她往这边来了！",
      "spkColor": "#90EE90"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "My window-plant is talking to me. He sounds excited.",
      "zh": "我的窗台植物在跟我说话。他听起来很兴奋。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Probably because he can convert sunlight into oxygen.",
      "zh": "大概是因为他能把阳光转化成氧气吧。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That would excite me too.",
      "zh": "那也会让我很兴奋。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good morning, Josh. I promise I will water you soon.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 早上好，Josh。我保证很快就给你浇水。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": All good, bro. Thanks.",
      "spk": "Josh",
      "zh": ": 没事，兄弟。谢了。",
      "spkColor": "#90EE90"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I got you.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 我懂你。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We bump fists.",
      "zh": "我们碰了碰拳。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Josh falls over. His guts spill everywhere.",
      "zh": "Josh 倒了下去。他的内脏洒了一地。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I didn’t mean for this to happen.",
      "zh": "我不是故意要这样的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sorry.",
      "zh": "对不起。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yuu? Are you awake?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": Yuu？你醒着吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m coming in.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 我进来了。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_worried",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_worried.png",
      "alt": "saki_worried"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey- what are you doing to Josh?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 喂 —— 你在对 Josh 做什么？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_angry",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_angry.png",
      "alt": "saki_angry"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are his guts all over your desk?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 为什么他的内脏洒了你一桌？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I made a terrible mistake.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 我犯了一个可怕的错误。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Jeez...It’s like you’re {i}trying{/i} to kill him.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 天啊……简直像是你{i}故意{/i}要杀他。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Saki walks over to Josh.",
      "zh": "Saki 走向 Josh。"
    },
    {
      "en": "She takes a water bottle out of her bag and pours the contents into his bed.",
      "zh": "她从包里拿出一个水瓶，把里面的东西倒进"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_happy",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_happy.png",
      "alt": "saki_happy"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here you go, little buddy.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 给你，小家伙。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": This will make you grow big and strong.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 这会让你长得又高又壮。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I LIVE! LIFE IS BEAUTIFUL!",
      "spk": "Josh",
      "zh": ": 我活了！人生真美好！",
      "spkColor": "#90EE90"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes it is, Josh. Yes it is.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 是啊，Josh。是啊。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_surprised",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_surprised.png",
      "alt": "saki_surprised"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh? Did you say something?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 啊？你说什么了吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who, me?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 谁，我吗？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_worried",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_worried.png",
      "alt": "saki_worried"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who else would I be talking to?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 不然我还能在跟谁说话？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I look at Josh. He has gone to sleep.",
      "zh": "我看向 Josh。他已经睡着了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Traitor.",
      "zh": "叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just talking to myself again.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 又是在自言自语而已。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_curious",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_curious.png",
      "alt": "saki_curious"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Internal monologue?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 内心独白？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something like that.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 差不多吧。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_normal",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_normal.png",
      "alt": "saki_normal"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 原来如此。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have you eaten breakfast yet?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 你吃过早饭了吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I brought you some things from the store, so feel free to eat whatever you'd like.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 我从店里给你带了点东西，想吃就吃吧。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Saki dumps the contents of her bag onto my bed.",
      "zh": "Saki 把包里的东西全倒在了我床上。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Several things fall onto the floor in the process.",
      "zh": "过程中有几样东西掉到了地上。"
    },
    {
      "en": "She bends down to pick them up.",
      "zh": "她弯下腰去捡。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I see her underwear.",
      "zh": "我看到了她的内裤。"
    },
    {
      "en": "A victory for all of mankind.",
      "zh": "全人类的胜利。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_surprised",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_surprised.png",
      "alt": "saki_surprised"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, so they were all out of the shoyu flavor cup-noodles and I had to buy you something else instead.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 哦，酱油味的杯面卖光了，所以我",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Define “Something else.”",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": ……请你先定义一下「别的东西」。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_happy",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_happy.png",
      "alt": "saki_happy"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This!",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 这个！",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Saki reveals a large head of cabbage she had been hiding in a separate bag and tosses it to me.",
      "zh": "Saki 掏出一整颗大卷心菜 —— 一直藏在她包里的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "This is the most unexciting surprise-gift I have ever received.",
      "zh": "这是我这辈子收到过的最不让人惊喜的惊喜礼物。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the hell am I supposed to do with this?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 我到底该拿这个干什么？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_normal",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_normal.png",
      "alt": "saki_normal"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The same thing you would do with shoyu ramen.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 跟你对酱油拉面做的一样。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Fill it with water and microwave it for sixty seconds?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": ……倒水进去，微波六十秒？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_angry",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_angry.png",
      "alt": "saki_angry"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": …",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": ……",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": …",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": ……",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh, okay. Fine.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 唔，好吧。行吧。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I bite into the head of cabbage.",
      "zh": "我朝那颗卷心菜咬了下去。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Josh watches in horror as I devour a distant relative.",
      "zh": "Josh 惊恐地看着我吞食他的远亲。"
    },
    {
      "en": "This is what you get for abandoning me when I needed you most.",
      "zh": "这就是你在我最需要你的时候抛弃我的下场。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_surprised",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_surprised.png",
      "alt": "saki_surprised"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re...supposed to wash it first.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 你……应该先洗一下的。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_worried",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_worried.png",
      "alt": "saki_worried"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And people don’t normally eat cabbage right off of the head…",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 而且一般人不会直接对着整颗卷心菜啃……",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well how was I supposed to know that?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 那我怎么知道啊？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is a whole new world for me.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 对我来说，这是个全新的世界。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_normal",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_normal.png",
      "alt": "saki_normal"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pfft- Heh…",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 噗 —— 嘿……",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_happy",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_happy.png",
      "alt": "saki_happy"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahahahahahahah~",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": Hahahahahahahah~",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hahahahahahah.",
      "zh": "Hahahahahahah."
    },
    {
      "en": "Hahahahahahah.",
      "zh": "Hahahahahahah."
    },
    {
      "en": "Hahah~",
      "zh": "Hahah~"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_normal",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_normal.png",
      "alt": "saki_normal"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can be pretty ridiculous sometimes, you know that?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 你有时候真的挺离谱的，你自己知道吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, I know. You remind me every chance you get.",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 哦，我知道。你一有机会就提醒我。",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I’m going to keep reminding you until the day we die.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 而且我会一直提醒你，直到我们死去的那一天。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, until the day we die?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 等等，直到我们死去的那一天？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re planning on putting up with me for that long?",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 你打算忍受我那么久？",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_surprised",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_surprised.png",
      "alt": "saki_surprised"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. Why wouldn’t I?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 当然。为什么不呢？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t we engaged now?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 我们现在不是已经订婚了吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "…",
      "zh": "……"
    },
    {
      "en": "What?!",
      "zh": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?!",
      "spk": "Yuu",
      "zh": ": 什么？！",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I repeat the words inside of my head.",
      "zh": "我在脑子里把这句话重复了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Didn’t you propose yesterday?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 你昨天不是求婚了吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You asked me to marry you in the storage- Err, {i}club{/i} room. Right after I brought up hamburger steak.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 你在储藏 —— 呃，{i}社团{/i}室里求我嫁给你的。",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Weren’t you paying attention to my answer?",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 你没在听我的回答吗？",
      "spkColor": "#A96CC7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene club_sepia",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/club_sepia.png",
      "alt": "club_sepia"
    },
    {
      "en": "show saki_sepia",
      "zh": "",
      "cap": true
    },
    {
      "img": "pic/_nib/saki_sepia.png",
      "alt": "saki_sepia"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t think he did. But okay.",
      "spk": "Saki",
      "zh": ": 我……不觉得他求过。不过好吧。",
